# The street door: double glass doors in a walnut frame under a transom, teal
# kick panels, brass pulls. Place it over two D cells on the lower face row.
# Tagged window so the sky shows through the glass by the hour.
sprite lobby-entrance
size 32 48
layer wall
footprint 2 1
origin 0 32
tag wall door window entrance

frame default
